## Shared Web consumption ΓÇö FSATS behavior under Falcon-wide AI emergency containment

Shared Web has consumed the bounded Application disposition in comment `5275794489` for current ideas/architecture planning.

Planning result preserved:

- Awareness/AI containment does not erase authoritative FSATS business state and does not transfer business ownership or authority;
- the exact target/dependency matrix across MSA/LSA/eligible CSA/Monitor AI/AI-enabled components remains unresolved and shall not be guessed by Web;
